# Syntactically valid OBJ with real vertex positions but zero faces -
# a distinct failure mode from corrupt.obj (which has no valid records
# at all): this file parses cleanly, but DecodeMeshOBJ must still
# reject it, since an empty mesh (no faces) cannot be uploaded to the
# GPU.

v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0
